00443              * INTERPASS FUNCTION







---


PAGE  012   RES2S FD          



00445              * IF BIT 0 OF (PASS) = 1 THEN BIT 0 OF (PASS)
00446              * IS SET TO 0 AND 31HEX IS RETURNED IN A-REG.
00447              *
00448              * IF BIT 0 OF (PASS) IS 0 THEN (PASS) IS SET
00449              * TO 00 AND (30HEX + (PASS) SHIFTED RIGHT ONE
00450              * BIT POSITION) IS RETURNED IN A-REG.
00451              *
00452              * IF (PASS) = 00 THEN JUMP TO UPDATE OCCURRS.


00454      F297    IPASS  EQU    * 

00456 F297 CE 0000        LDX    #PASS 
00457 F29A 86 01          LDA A  #1 
00458 F29C A5 00          BIT A  X 
00459 F29E 27 05          BEQ    PASS2 
00460 F2A0 6A 00          DEC    X 
00461 F2A2 8B 30   PASS3  ADD A  #$30 
00462 F2A4 39             RTS             

00464 F2A5 6D 00   PASS2  TST    0,X 
00465 F2A7 27 0F          BEQ    PASS4 
00466 F2A9 BD F03B        JSR    RESTR 
00467 F2AC CE 0000        LDX    #PASS 
00468 F2AF 0C             CLC             
00469 F2B0 66 00          ROR    X 
00470 F2B2 A6 00          LDA A  X 
00471 F2B4 6F 00          CLR    X 
00472 F2B6 20 EA          BRA    PASS3 

00474 F2B8 7E 0043 PASS4  JMP    $43 





00476              *  PHYSICAL SECTOR TABLE. IS IN ORDER OF
00477              *  LOGICAL SECTOR NUMBER.



00479      F2BA    TBL    EQU    *-1 

00481 F2BB 01             FCB    $1 
00482 F2BC 0A             FCB    $A 
00483 F2BD 13             FCB    $13 
00484 F2BE 02             FCB    $2 
